aysInStock\":173,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-04-10 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"**2024 Rolls-Royce Cullinan Base &ndash; The Pinnacle of Luxury SUV Excellence**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is honored to present this exceptional 2024 Rolls-Royce Cullinan, finished in the striking and exclusive Burnout Gray. With just 17,212 carefully driven miles, this ultra-luxury SUV represents the perfect marriage of commanding presence and uncompromising refinement.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Unparalleled Power and Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this magnificent machine lies a formidable 6.7-liter twin-turbocharged V12 engine, delivering effortless power through an 8-speed automatic transmission. The permanent all-wheel-drive system, coupled with adaptive air suspension and automatic ride control, ensures a magic carpet ride regardless of terrain. Hill descent control, hill hold, and electric parking brake provide complete confidence in any driving situation.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exquisite Comfort and Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover a sanctuary of luxury featuring **heated front bucket seats** with 12-way power adjustment, memory settings, and **massage functionality**. The premium natural-grain leather seating extends throughout the cabin, complemented by carbon-fiber and metal-look accents. Both the driver and passenger enjoy **ventilated front seats** for year-round comfort, while rear passengers are pampered with heated 60-40 folding bench seats and a convenient rear-seat table.<br\\\/><br\\\/>The advanced infotainment system features **wireless Apple CarPlay**, an 18-speaker audio system with rear entertainment, navigation with real-time traffic, and a stunning 12.3-inch display. The heated leather steering wheel, head-up display, and dual-zone climate control with rear HVAC ensure every journey is perfection.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Safety and Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Cullinan comes equipped with an aerial-view camera system, front and rear parking sensors, blind-spot monitoring, lane-departure warning, and collision warning. The panoramic sliding glass sunroof, power liftgate, soft-close doors, and 22-inch part-polished Black Badge wheels complete this extraordinary package.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**AUTOCHECK Clean** &ndash; Stock #86091S \\\/ VIN: SLATV8C03RU222585<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience automotive royalty at Prestige Imports. This is more than transportation&mdash;it's a statement. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Sport Utility\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Sport Utility\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":12,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-rolls-royce-cullinan-black-badge-north-miami-beach-fl-id-64656005\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Rolls-Royce-Cullinan-Black-Badge-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-SLATV8C03RU222585\\\/sz_115637\\\/bc482f812c452c4ea7e4f9cdfcbe10f9.jpg\",\"photoCount\":59,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":